 ('ENT_ISR_ABIJAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_REHOBOAM','high','Abijah son of Rehoboam succeeded his father (1 Kings 15:1).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JEHORAM_JUDAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_JEHOSHAPHAT','high','Jehoram son of Jehoshaphat succeeded him (2 Kings 8:16).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_AHAZIAH_JUDAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_JEHORAM_JUDAH','high','Ahaziah son of Jehoram of Judah succeeded him (2 Kings 8:24-25).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_AHAZIAH_JUDAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_ATHALIAH','high','Ahaziah''s mother was Athaliah daughter of Omri (2 Kings 8:26).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JOASH_JUDAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_AHAZIAH_JUDAH','high','Joash son of Ahaziah was hidden and enthroned after Athaliah (2 Kings 11:2).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_AMAZIAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_JOASH_JUDAH','high','Amaziah son of Joash succeeded his father (2 Kings 14:1).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_UZZIAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_AMAZIAH','high','Azariah/Uzziah son of Amaziah succeeded him (2 Kings 15:1).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JOTHAM','child_of','ENT_ISR_UZZIAH','high','Jotham son of Uzziah succeeded his father (2 Kings 15:32-33).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_AHAZ','child_of','ENT_ISR_JOTHAM','high','Ahaz son of Jotham succeeded his father (2 Kings 16:1).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_AMON_JUDAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_MANASSEH','high','Amon son of Manasseh succeeded his father (2 Kings 21:18-19).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JOSIAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_AMON_JUDAH','high','Josiah son of Amon succeeded his father (2 Kings 21:24,26).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JEHOAHAZ_JUDAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_JOSIAH','high','Jehoahaz son of Josiah was made king after his father (2 Kings 23:30-31).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JEHOIAKIM','child_of','ENT_ISR_JOSIAH','high','Eliakim/Jehoiakim son of Josiah was installed by Necho (2 Kings 23:34).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_ZEDEKIAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_JOSIAH','high','Mattaniah/Zedekiah son of Josiah was installed by Nebuchadnezzar (2 Kings 24:17).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JEHOIACHIN','child_of','ENT_ISR_JEHOIAKIM','high','Jehoiachin son of Jehoiakim succeeded his father (2 Kings 24:6).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_NADAB','child_of','ENT_ISR_JEROBOAM_I','high','Nadab son of Jeroboam I succeeded his father (1 Kings 15:25).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_ELAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_BAASHA','high','Elah son of Baasha succeeded his father (1 Kings 16:6,8).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_AHAZIAH_ISRAEL','child_of','ENT_ISR_AHAB','high','Ahaziah son of Ahab succeeded his father (1 Kings 22:40,51).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JEHORAM_ISRAEL','child_of','ENT_ISR_AHAB','high','Jehoram son of Ahab became king after his brother Ahaziah (2 Kings 3:1).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JEHOAHAZ_ISRAEL','child_of','ENT_ISR_JEHU','high','Jehoahaz son of Jehu succeeded his father (2 Kings 13:1).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JEHOASH_ISRAEL','child_of','ENT_ISR_JEHOAHAZ_ISRAEL','high','Jehoash son of Jehoahaz succeeded his father (2 Kings 13:9-10).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JEROBOAM_II','child_of','ENT_ISR_JEHOASH_ISRAEL','high','Jeroboam II son of Jehoash succeeded his father (2 Kings 14:23).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_ZECHARIAH_ISRAEL','child_of','ENT_ISR_JEROBOAM_II','high','Zechariah son of Jeroboam II succeeded his father (2 Kings 15:8).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_PEKAHIAH','child_of','ENT_ISR_MENAHEM','high','Pekahiah son of Menahem succeeded his father (2 Kings 15:22-23).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_ZIMRI','slays','ENT_ISR_ELAH','high','Zimri struck down and killed Elah at Tirzah (1 Kings 16:9-10).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_BAASHA','slays','ENT_ISR_NADAB','high','Baasha killed Nadab at Gibbethon and reigned in his place (1 Kings 15:27-28).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_SHALLUM_ISRAEL','slays','ENT_ISR_ZECHARIAH_ISRAEL','high','Shallum conspired against and killed Zechariah (2 Kings 15:10).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_MENAHEM','slays','ENT_ISR_SHALLUM_ISRAEL','high','Menahem struck down Shallum and reigned in his place (2 Kings 15:14).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_PEKAH','slays','ENT_ISR_PEKAHIAH','high','Pekah killed Pekahiah in Samaria and reigned in his place (2 Kings 15:25).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_HOSHEA','slays','ENT_ISR_PEKAH','high','Hoshea conspired against and killed Pekah (2 Kings 15:30).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JEHU','slays','ENT_ISR_JEHORAM_ISRAEL','high','Jehu shot and killed Joram/Jehoram during his coup (2 Kings 9:24).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_JEHU','slays','ENT_ISR_AHAZIAH_JUDAH','high','Jehu had Ahaziah of Judah struck down during his revolt (2 Kings 9:27).'),
 ('ENT_ISR_ATHALIAH','opposes','ENT_ISR_KINGS_JUDAH','medium','Athaliah destroyed the Davidic royal heirs to seize Judah''s throne (2 Kings 11:1).'),
